WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.634
-Finally, we have
exactly 12 shows left

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:03.834
before we go on Christmas break.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.200
Yeah, that's right.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.601
Which means it's time for
that beloved

00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:07.767
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:11.734
It's time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters"!

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:14.100
-♪ "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.767
♪ 12 days left ♪

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.834
-That's right.

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:20.968
Every show between
now and Christmas,

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:22.934
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.000
an out-of-this-world
Christmas sweater

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.834
from the Countdown to
Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:33.968
Since there are 12 shows left,
let's open door number 12.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:35.267
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:36.434
Hello.
-Hello.

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:39.033
-Nice to meet you.
-Nice to meet you, too.

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:46.534
-Oh!
♪♪

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:48.334
It's a sweater.

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:51.834
Oh, my goodness.
This is like a...

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:54.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.968
Got mittens.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:59.000
It's got mittens there.
This is gorgeous.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.367
It's a Christmas sweater.

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:03.067
Now let's see who's going
home with tonight's sweater.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.067
Everyone look at
your seat number.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:07.601
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:09.367
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:11.300
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.734
Who wants a sweater?!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:18.367
It is 211!
♪♪

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.968
Come on over, bud. Hey.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.701
How you doing, bud?

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:30.634
Nice to see you.
Why don't you head over there.

00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:32.767
Yeah, go over there.
Nice to see you.

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:34.167
How are you? What is your name?

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:35.601
-Mike.
-Mike, where are you from?

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.033
-New York.
-Mike from New York. I love it.

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:38.834
-Whoo!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.801
I like your sweatshirt.

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.434
Is that just a politeness
or is that a weed reference?

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:47.067
-A little bit of --
A little bit of both.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:48.267
-A little bit of both. Yeah.

00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:49.701
Mike, in New York,
it gets a little cold.

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:50.934
Do you have anything
like this at home?

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:52.801
-I actually have
an elf onesie, so--

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:54.033
-Oh, this is
going to go perfect.

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.767
You can lend that out
to someone else

00:01:55.767 --> 00:01:56.901
and go to the party
wearing this one.

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:58.300
Would you like to try it on?
-I guess so.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.968
-Yeah, go for it. Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:02.033
Yes, that's very nice.

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.434
Alright, Mike,
this is going to be good.

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.234
Mike, I feel like
this is going to work.

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.434
-Yeah? You think so?
-Yeah.

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:11.000
I feel like this is your thing.
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.968
They're for--
You're forced to wear mittens

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:15.200
while wearing
this sweater, yeah.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.501
Oh, this is perfect.

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:19.133
The thumbs reverse
on that one, so, yeah,

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:22.000
you have to get your hand --
Oh, this is -- Mike...

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:28.033
-Thank you.
-Oh, my God.

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:29.501
There he goes right there,
Mike from New York.

00:02:29.501 --> 00:02:30.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:32.734
You look fantastic, buddy.
-Thank you.

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.067
-Let's give Mike
another round of applause.

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:35.200
Stick around.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.734
We'll be right back with
Adam Sandler, everybody.

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:38.767
Come on back.

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.934
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

